:= start
Alice: I am carrying [Alice.Stats.gold] gold, and there are [party_size()] of us.
<=> shape
[let $rich = richest()]
Bob: [$rich] is the one paying tonight then, with [$rich.Stats.gold] gold.
Alice: Fine. Watch this.
>> hurt(Alice, 8)
Alice: ... that went badly.
<=> shape
Bob: Let's go home.
---

:= shape
[if Alice has Wounded]
    Alice: Sorry, I can't do that. I only have [Alice.Stats.hp] health points.
[else]
    Alice: And I am in good enough shape to face the dragon.
---
